i, and blooming pink flowers\n✨ Wooden plant stands & cozy shelf arrangements\n✨ Cute pastel aesthetics with a soft watercolor feel\n✨ 22 unique plant & planter variations\n✨ Transparent PNG backgrounds\n✨ High-resolution 300 DPI files\n✨ Easy to use for personal and small commercial projects\n\n🪴 COMMERCIAL USE\n✅ You may use these designs for personal use, educational projects, and small business/commercial projects.\n✅ You may modify, resize, recolor, combine, and incorporate the illustrations into your own finished products for sale.\n❌ You may NOT resell, share, redistribute, or give away the original PNG files as standalone digital artwork.\n❌ Do not sell the original clipart files or modified versions of the artwork as digital clipart for others to download or reuse.\n\nPlease note: This is a digital download only. No physical products will be shipped.\n\nThank you so much for visiting my shop! 💚\nI hope these cute skull planters bring a little botanical joy and sweet spooky aesthetic to your creative projects. 🌵💀🌸✨\nEnjoy creating!\n\nJ.NUTCHANIT",
